message: "For the SoftwareX article, use the current repository package and record its exact commit. Cite the v1.1.1 DOI as the numerical-core archive; the current study companions are identified separately in the manuscript."
title: "FRACMATH: Vectorized continuum damage simulation with hybrid GPU computing, crack-band regularization and an Abaqus UMAT"
